      "disposition": "Retain the tuple/Hashable boundary as a limitation note. The answer accurately describes the ABC precheck and does not explicitly promise that every Hashable object can be hashed without error or that tag updates are transactional; omission of that extra edge is not counted as a concrete false assertion."
